  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "7",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "7",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremia okorandia ase Hekalu ime",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ring’ana rigacha ase Yeremia korwa ase Omonene, rikamoteebia",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Genda agwo ase egeita ki’enyomba y’Omonene, na aroro agwo orarie ring’ana eri: Igwa ring’ana ri’Omonene, inwe abanto bonsi ba Yuda aba mogosoa ase ebiita ebio komosasiima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Onchora chinchera chiaino, na ogokora kwaino, na inche nimbatige mogenderere komenya aase aiga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Timobaisa kwegena amang’ana ’obong’ainereria ayio agotebwa: Mbuya tore. Eye nero Hekalu y’Omonene, eye nero Hekalu y’Omonene, eye nero Hekalu y’Omonene!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Onchora chinchera chiaino na ogokora kwaino, naende mokorerane oboronge, kera omonto noyonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motige gokorera bobe omonto omomenyi ore ase more, ne chintakana, na ababoraka, gose aase aiga timoitera amanyinga ’abaanto batari na komocha, naende motige gosasiima chinyasae ching’ao chiria chirabarentere ogosirigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komoraonchoke, erio inche nimbatige mogenderere komenya aase aiga ase ense naete chisokoro chiaino agwo kare ng’a ebe eyabo kogenderera botambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bono inwe nigo mwegenete amang’ana ’obong’ainereria atari kobakonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Nigo mogochia kogenderera koiba, na goita, na gotomana, na gotiana ase oborimo, na gosamba ubani ase enyasae eria Baali, naende gosasiima chinyasae chinde ching’ao, echio motamanyeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio onsi nigo mokoyakora, naende mwachicha ase obosio bwane ase enyomba eye ekorokwa ase erieta riane mwateba: Twatoorigwe! Erio mogendererete gokora okogechia okwo?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Enyomba eye ekorokwa ase erieta riane iyabeire rikuruma ri’abauri ase more? Inche omonyene narorire amang’ana ayio mogokora. Nabo inche Omonene natebiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Genda bono aase nechorerete agwo Silo; agwo nao ritang’ani nabegete erieta riane rimenyeo. Mwerorere egento nakorete aase aria ase engencho y’obokayayu bw’abaanto baane Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende inche Omonene nigo ngoteeba iga: Bono mwakorire amang’ana aya onsi, timorigeti koigwera ekero ngendererete gokwana nainwe, na ekero nabarangeretie timwaitabete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase engencho eyio ninkore enyomba eye ekorokwa ase erieta riane, eye inwe mwegenete, buna nakorete Silo, na ense eye naete chisokoro chiaino amo nainwe ebe boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbaserie morue ase obosio bwane, buna naseretie abanto bamino, ororeria rwonsi rw’Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogotaigwera kw’abaanto",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye Yeremia, tobaisa gosabera abanto aba, gose korera ase engencho y’abwo. Tobaisa gocha gonsorora ase engencho y’abwo, ekiagera tingokoigwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inee! Aye torochi amang’ana bagokora agwo ase emechie y’Abayuda, na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abana nigo bagochora chinko, na abaise bauta omorero, na abakungu bagokonya obosie koroisia emegati ase enyasae enkungu eria ekorokwa Eting’ana ya Igoro. Naende baumora okoruegwa kw’ebinyugwa ase chinyasae ching’ao, bangechia naba nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inche Omonene nigo nkoboria: Inee! Ninche bakogechia? Tibari gwekorera barabwo abanyene amabe na konyora obosooku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: Ning’umore endamwamu yane enene, na okogechia kwane igoro y’aase aiga, na igoro ase Mwanyabaanto, ne ching’iti, na emete y’orosana, na ase chindagera chionsi chi’emegondo. Endamwamu eyio yane nigo eroke buna omorero, na onde tari oranyare koyerimia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene bw’Emeganda, Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, agoteeba: Menta ebing’wanso biaino bi’ogosambwa ase ebing’wanso binde, morie chinyama echio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko riria narusetie chisokoro chiaino korwa ase ense ya Misiri, tinabateebeetie gose tinabachigete igoro ase ebing’wanso bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende nkabachika, nkabateebia: Monyigwere, na inche nimbe Nyasae oino, na inwe mobe abanto baane. Mobwatie chinchera chionsi nabachiikire, erio nario erabe buya ase more.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abanto abwo tibanyigwerete, korende bakabwatia ogosemania kwabo abanyene, na oboenenu bwe chinkoro chiabo chi’ebibe. Bakairana gochia magega, gose tibagendererete gochia bosio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa engaki eria chisokoro chiaino chiaruete ase ense ya Misiri goika rituko ria reero nabeire nkogenderera gotoma abasomba baane ababani ase more, rituko ase rituko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya naboigo tibanyigwerete, gose gotegerera amang’ana aane, korende bakaba abanyabigoti bikong’u. Bakagenderera gokora amabe mono kobua chisokoro chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Yeremia, obateebie amang’ana ayio onsi, korende barabwo tibakogotegerera. Nobarangerie, korende tibakogoitabera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obateebie ng’a egesaku eke nakio getamoigwereti Omonene, Nyasae obo, naende tigiancheti Omonene akerongeyie. Ekeene giasirire korwa ase emenwa yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokora kw’ebibe ase Rikura ria Hinomu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kigita chitukia chiaino, mochitugute,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "aka eriogi ri’okweng’ereria agwo ase ebigoro bire bosa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ekiagera Omonene bwangire na otigire abanto b’ekegori eke,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kiagerire ere abeire nendamwamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omonene oteebire: Abanto ba Yuda bakorire ebibe ase obosio bwane, babekire emegwekano y’okogechia ase enyomba eria ekorokwa ase erieta riane, bayekorire yabeire eyetachenegeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo baroisirie aase aimokererete igoro agosasimerwa agwo ase Tofeti, aaria ase Rikura ria mosinto o Hinomu. Agwo basambire abana babo, abamura na abaiseke, nomorero, amang’ana inche ntachigete gose atana koba ase ebirengererio biane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende Omonene oteebire: Rora, amatuko ngocha are, aase aria atarokwe Tofeti, gose Rikura ria mosinto o Hinomu, korende ndirokwe Rikura ri’Okonyenyera. Abanto mbatindekwe agwo Tofeti, ekiagera aase ande tari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emebere yabo ekwete nebe endagera ye chinyoni chia igoro ne ching’iti chi’orosana. Omonto tagochiseria ekero chikoria emebere eyio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase emechie y’Abayuda na ase chinchera chia Yerusalemu ninsirie eriogi ri’omogooko na eri’omochengo, na eriogi ri’omonywomi na eri’omoriakari, ekiagera ense yabo nebe bosa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.7.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
